# Creature routes by size (src/lab/tubes/VentRoutes.cpp): two rooms (north y 1-9, south y 14-22, x 1-13) parted by a
# 4 m wall, a concrete culvert (bld_culvert) through it. A 1 m culvert (0.78 m inside, prone only) at x 4-5
# and the long way round through the east gap. A Huntsman at 0.55 scale (0.58 m) follows the player through it;
# a full-size Huntsman (1.05 m) and the Brute (1.85 m) go round.
size 640 360
frames 1500
vent-x 4.5
vent-width 1
runner-1 Huntsman 0.55 through 2.5 3
runner-2 Huntsman 1 around 7.5 2.5
runner-3 Brute 1 around 10 4
begin-campaign
